   7:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   * @brief   RNG HAL module driver.
   8:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following 
   9:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   *          functionalities of the Random Number Generator (RNG) peripheral:
  10:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   *           + Initialization/de-initialization functions
  11:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   *           + Peripheral Control functions 
  12:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   *           + Peripheral State functions
  13:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   *         
  14:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   @verbatim
  15:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   ==============================================================================
  16:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****                      ##### How to use this driver #####
  17:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   ==============================================================================
  18:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   [..]
  19:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****       The RNG HAL driver can be used as follows:
  20:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c **** 
  21:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****       (#) Enable the RNG controller clock using __HAL_RCC_RNG_CLK_ENABLE() macro 
  22:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****           in HAL_RNG_MspInit().
  23:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****       (#) Activate the RNG peripheral using HAL_RNG_Init() function.
  24:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****       (#) Wait until the 32 bit Random Number Generator contains a valid 
  25:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****           random data using (polling/interrupt) mode.   
  26:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****       (#) Get the 32 bit random number using HAL_RNG_GenerateRandomNumber() function.
  27:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   
  28:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   @endverbatim
  29:../.././hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/stm32f4/stm32f4xx_hal_rng.c ****   ******************************************************************************
